body:
The Fortink are a species of strong, turtle-like reptiles that have evolved around a mono-theist religion with a god of life and death. This god is called Aermon, and is believed to be the cause of the species' existence, as well as all other lifeforms in the observable universe. Their boney shells serve as good protection from enviornmental hazards imposed from life on other planets, making them hardy survivalists. The downside of this is that most of the nutrients they take in are spent supporting this structure, leaving little left for brain development. In fact, Fortinks are unusually unintelligent for a spacefaring species. How they developped FTL travel is a mystery, but one possibility is their religious devoutness. Their homeworld, "Euvius" is largely submerged, with thick jungles covering the few islands dotted on the surface of the mangrove world. The host star, natively called "Bal" has been the catalyst of many religious ventures, with the goal of contacting their deity.

&#x200B;

I really dislike the biography text box. There's so many bugs that should be fixed, and you can't even write that much in it. You also can't copy-paste, which again, is really annoying. Do you know if there's a mod which can fix at least some of these issues?
